<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong gold closed for New Year holiday.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong gold closed for New Year holiday.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's gold markets will be closed on January 1, 1997, for the New Year holiday. They will reopen on Thursday, January 2.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
